1
00:01:40,159 --> 00:01:41,519
The ceremony has been going on for a while.

2
00:01:41,519 --> 00:01:42,799
Xiaozhen won't skip it, will she?

3
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:44,040
She isn't replying to WeChat either.

4
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,000
No way.

5
00:01:47,319 --> 00:01:47,760
Let's wait a bit more.

6
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:55,079
Let me show you something.

7
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,799
Isn't this Yang Xiaofan?

8
00:02:02,560 --> 00:02:03,439
What is he doing now?

9
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,040
He got married last year.

10
00:02:06,519 --> 00:02:07,480
He registered the marriage in the Netherlands.

11
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:08,960
He married a foreigner?

12
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:11,599
She's quite pretty.

13
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:15,960
Did you know he used to like you?

14
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:22,439
He was originally going to confess to you.

15
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,400
But I stopped him.

16
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,680
Because I didn't think he was good enough for you.

17
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,199
No wonder

18
00:02:27,199 --> 00:02:28,759
he blocked me.

19
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:30,879
Sometimes,

20
00:02:31,639 --> 00:02:33,280
am I a bit too controlling?

21
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,000
Next time, don't rush to take on all the dirty

22
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,919
and hard work.

23
00:02:39,759 --> 00:02:40,639
Let me do it myself.

24
00:02:45,159 --> 00:02:46,360
Is she coming or not?

25
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,159
Did she

26
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:50,479
come and leave already?

27
00:02:52,759 --> 00:02:53,280
Wait a bit longer.

28
00:02:54,439 --> 00:02:55,080
Let's wait.

29
00:02:57,599 --> 00:02:58,680
But what if she never shows up?

30
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:00,680
Then...

31
00:03:01,120 --> 00:03:01,680
we leave.

32
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,680
But what if

33
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,560
she shows up right after we leave?

34
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:07,639
Then we can't leave.

35
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:52,000
A recent call, five minutes!

36
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,840
And I was the one who called him.

37
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,439
I'm done for.

38
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,360
What did I say?

39
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:02,599
After drinking,

40
00:04:02,599 --> 00:04:04,360
I shouldn't have used my phone.

41
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:04,960
It's over.

42
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,960
What did I say?

43
00:04:17,079 --> 00:04:19,160
From now on, lock up your phone before drink.

44
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:41,759
Thanks.

45
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:56,399
I'm going to make a major decision.

46
00:04:57,319 --> 00:04:59,120
I'm going to kick you out.

47
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,600
Out of my head.

48
00:05:01,879 --> 00:05:03,600
I don't want to think about you anymore.

49
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,439
Jerk.

50
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,120
Really?

51
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:31,279
Just one phone call,

52
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:32,319
and he came back early?

53
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:36,160
Interesting.

54
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,319
So, Bai Yang,

55
00:05:42,319 --> 00:05:43,680
I happen to have a few friends

56
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:45,199
who want to visit Hengshi.

57
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:46,759
Please arrange it.

58
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:49,319
Let Ruan accompany us the whole time.

59
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,519
She even slapped him,

60
00:05:53,079 --> 00:05:54,720
yet one call brought him back early.

61
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,839
I have to see

62
00:05:55,839 --> 00:05:57,160
what kind of person she is.

63
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,000
Right?

64
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,560
That's all for today.

65
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:03,879
Sixian,

66
00:06:04,639 --> 00:06:05,959
wait a moment. I want to talk to you.

67
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:09,000
Honestly, I really admire you.

68
00:06:09,319 --> 00:06:10,720
You've improved a lot recently.

69
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:13,000
It's all thanks to your teaching.

70
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:13,839
No, no,

71
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,040
I think you have a natural talent.

72
00:06:15,519 --> 00:06:16,360
How about this?

73
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:17,399
Later, the two of us

74
00:06:17,399 --> 00:06:18,079
can grab a late-night snack.

75
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,600
I'll pass on the snack.

76
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,360
I have to get up early tomorrow morning.

77
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,120
That's true.

78
00:06:22,519 --> 00:06:22,920
How about this?

79
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:23,800
Let's go outside and

80
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,800
grab a quick bite.

81
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,240
It won't take long, okay?

82
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,160
Ziyue.

83
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:33,879
Ruan, wait.

84
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:48,759
Jiang,

85
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:50,959
what are you doing here?

86
00:06:51,319 --> 00:06:52,839
I came to bring Captain Yue a late-night snack.

87
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:54,920
That's very thoughtful of you, Jiang.

88
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:55,879
But next time,

89
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,199
you don't need to go to so much trouble.

90
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:59,240
If you could just come home earlier next time,

91
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,439
I wouldn't need to go to all this trouble.

92
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,800
Go ahead and talk.

93
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:02,560
I'll head out first.

94
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:04,199
Ruan, I'll walk you out.

95
00:07:25,199 --> 00:07:26,519
Ruan, I'll be straightforward.

96
00:07:28,959 --> 00:07:29,839
During this time,

97
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:31,399
Yue Yang and I are indeed dating.

98
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:35,079
I know that recently,

99
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,680
because of simulator practice,

100
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,600
you two have interactions at work.

101
00:07:39,759 --> 00:07:40,519
I hope

102
00:07:40,759 --> 00:07:42,000
that from now on, in the evenings,

103
00:07:43,399 --> 00:07:44,639
actually, at all times,

104
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:47,120
you can avoid Yue Yang's schedule.

105
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:49,240
Sorry, Ziyue,

106
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,279
I can't do that.

107
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,439
The simulator is extremely hard to book.

108
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,720
As long as I have time

109
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,879
and there's an open slot,

110
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:56,360
I will work hard to grab it.

111
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:57,680
Because I value

112
00:07:57,680 --> 00:07:58,839
every minute of practice.

113
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:00,439
You can rest assured.

114
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:01,680
Instructor Yue and I

115
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:03,759
are just colleagues,

116
00:08:04,480 --> 00:08:05,600
a senior-junior relationship.

117
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:07,639
Beyond that,

118
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:09,160
there will be nothing between us.

119
00:08:09,759 --> 00:08:10,240
Sixian,

120
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,839
we've known each other for years.

121
00:08:14,839 --> 00:08:15,639
Over the years,

122
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,560
your transformation

123
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,879
has been witnessed by all of us.

124
00:08:18,439 --> 00:08:20,319
3 years ago, you're the most beautiful flight attendant.

125
00:08:21,319 --> 00:08:21,920
Now,

126
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,720
you are even more

127
00:08:23,720 --> 00:08:24,639
a star pilot of the airline.

128
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,920
You're so beautiful.

129
00:08:26,120 --> 00:08:27,800
The male colleagues

130
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,680
will definitely have their eyes on you.

131
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:29,680
Yue Yang,

132
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,720
I know him very well.

133
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,360
If he has acted inappropriately

134
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:34,799
toward you at work,

135
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,960
I apologize on his behalf.

136
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:39,279
However,

137
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,639
I still hope

138
00:08:41,879 --> 00:08:42,519
you can

139
00:08:42,519 --> 00:08:43,480
keep some distance from him.

140
00:08:46,159 --> 00:08:46,679
Ziyue,

141
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:48,440
everything you said today,

142
00:08:48,440 --> 00:08:50,240
and everything you've been worrying about is unnecessary.

143
00:08:50,919 --> 00:08:52,279
Maybe you don't know me well.

144
00:08:52,639 --> 00:08:53,240
But right now,

145
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,039
let me formally make this clear.

146
00:08:56,519 --> 00:08:57,320
No matter who I choose,

147
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:58,840
it will never be Yue Yang.

148
00:08:59,279 --> 00:09:00,279
What you treasure like a gem,

149
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,720
I see as worthless.

150
00:09:03,639 --> 00:09:04,600
Instead of worrying so much

151
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,080
about your so-called boyfriend being stolen,

152
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:08,360
why don't you tell him to stop being an instructor?

153
00:09:10,440 --> 00:09:11,240
Maybe

154
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,840
he'll meet someone else on a flight too.

155
00:09:14,120 --> 00:09:15,639
Then you might as well tell him to quit.

156
00:09:16,639 --> 00:09:18,240
You know exactly what it is

157
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:19,840
that makes you

158
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,919
so insecure about your relationship.

159
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:22,120
I'm very confident

160
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:23,200
in our relationship, okay?

161
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:24,679
Then why did you come to me today?

162
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:30,960
Ziyue,

163
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,559
if one day I fall in love,

164
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,200
I will walk with him

165
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:37,120
openly in the sunlight.

166
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,480
I don't want myself,

167
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:40,879
and even more, I don't want him,

168
00:09:41,159 --> 00:09:42,360
hiding in a dark corner,

169
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,200
unknown to anyone.

170
00:09:43,759 --> 00:09:44,519
I believe you

171
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:46,240
give your all to your love.

172
00:09:46,759 --> 00:09:47,840
But you also need to be clear-headed.

173
00:09:48,080 --> 00:09:49,840
What's most dangerous in love

174
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,519
is drinking poison to quench thirst.

175
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:55,879
Ruan Sixian,

176
00:09:55,879 --> 00:09:57,240
I don't need you to teach me about love.

177
00:09:58,879 --> 00:10:00,159
I know better than anyone

178
00:10:00,159 --> 00:10:01,279
the feelings between Yue Yang and me.

179
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,000
Yes,

180
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,559
I do worry.

181
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,279
That's because I care.

182
00:10:07,879 --> 00:10:08,879
I'm not like you.

183
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:11,679
Mr. Fu treats you so well,

184
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,879
like you're the apple of his eye.

185
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:17,480
All these years, your love life and career

186
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,200
have gone smoothly.

187
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:21,039
You've risen to the top overnight.

188
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:23,039
Of course you have a sense of security.

189
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,559
But what about me?

190
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:31,879
Whether Yue Yang loves you

191
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,720
or wants to be with you,

192
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:36,120
I believe you know

193
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,200
better than any of us.

194
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:38,720
Ziyue,

195
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,799
being cautious is not wrong.

196
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:43,919
But if you pour all your love into guarding,

197
00:10:44,279 --> 00:10:45,120
then that love

198
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:46,919
is questionable.

199
00:10:48,039 --> 00:10:48,960
Real caring

200
00:10:49,399 --> 00:10:50,000
shouldn't make you

201
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,279
walk on eggshells.

202
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,159
I've said

203
00:10:55,879 --> 00:10:56,360
all I needed to say.

204
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:58,799
I'm leaving now.

205
00:11:21,279 --> 00:11:22,240
I... I'm fine.

206
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:28,039
You really brought me

207
00:11:29,480 --> 00:11:30,279
quite a surprise.

208
00:11:31,639 --> 00:11:32,000
Got it.

209
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,000
What do you mean?

210
00:11:34,039 --> 00:11:35,080
You got what you wanted.

211
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,919
What did I want?

212
00:11:38,639 --> 00:11:39,679
What did you come here for today?

213
00:11:42,519 --> 00:11:43,000
Um,

214
00:11:43,679 --> 00:11:44,480
what I brought you is

215
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,120
from that place you've been wanting to try.

216
00:11:46,279 --> 00:11:47,039
I waited in line for a long time.

217
00:11:47,039 --> 00:11:48,039
So now you're starting

218
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,600
to interfere with my work, is that it?

219
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,399
No, I didn't.

220
00:11:51,559 --> 00:11:52,080
How can you say you didn't?

221
00:11:52,879 --> 00:11:53,759
Starting tomorrow,

222
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,559
I'll cancel

223
00:11:54,559 --> 00:11:55,639
all my evening trainee lessons.

224
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,039
I'll cancel daytime flights too.

225
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:00,360
And then I should just quit the airline?

226
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,440
What we just said,

227
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:06,720
you heard all of it?

228
00:12:08,159 --> 00:12:08,840
It was pretty loud.

229
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,519
You know that's not what I meant.

230
00:12:13,159 --> 00:12:14,039
Then what did you mean?

231
00:12:14,519 --> 00:12:15,120
The way I see it,

232
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:16,440
you've already

233
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,799
affected our work today.

234
00:12:20,399 --> 00:12:21,639
What do you mean, "our"?

235
00:12:21,639 --> 00:12:22,919
Ruan Sixian's and my

236
00:12:22,919 --> 00:12:24,000
work tonight.

237
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:24,440
I think

238
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,480
I've made myself clear enough.

239
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:33,600
Yue Yang,

240
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,240
ask yourself:

241
00:12:36,799 --> 00:12:38,279
is it that I affected you,

242
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:41,000
or that you yourself

243
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,159
have those little schemes in mind?

244
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,879
So I have little schemes in mind?

245
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,000
How come I don't know?

246
00:12:46,799 --> 00:12:47,879
Aren't you supposed to know me well?

247
00:12:48,600 --> 00:12:49,399
Go on, tell me.

248
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:51,879
Right now, I feel like

249
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:52,559
you're

250
00:12:53,159 --> 00:12:54,080
questioning my professionalism.

251
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:56,039
First,

252
00:12:57,039 --> 00:12:58,080
I've been flying for over a decade.

253
00:12:58,600 --> 00:12:59,559
I can separate

254
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,720
work and life.

255
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,080
Second,

256
00:13:01,919 --> 00:13:02,840
in my opinion,

257
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,240
Ruan Sixian is simply

258
00:13:04,240 --> 00:13:05,360
an excellent pilot.

259
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,200
I want to mentor her.

260
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:06,639
Third,

261
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:08,159
if I really did something

262
00:13:08,159 --> 00:13:09,440
that made her uncomfortable,

263
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,559
she could report it to her superior

264
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,840
or to the president.

265
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,559
But she didn't,

266
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:13,679
which proves I didn't do

267
00:13:14,039 --> 00:13:14,919
anything wrong either.

268
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:15,960
Fourth,

269
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:18,200
in my heart, you've always been

270
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,840
an outstanding and perfect girl.

271
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,399
But today,

272
00:13:21,399 --> 00:13:22,639
your actions made me feel

273
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:24,480
pretty uncomfortable.

274
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,639
It ruined the image I had of you.

275
00:13:27,360 --> 00:13:28,279
I just hoped

276
00:13:28,279 --> 00:13:29,720
you could care about me a bit more.

277
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,120
How should I care about you?

278
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:32,399
You used to

279
00:13:32,399 --> 00:13:33,360
share everything with me.

280
00:13:33,919 --> 00:13:34,879
What you were doing,

281
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:35,879
what you were up to,

282
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:37,279
what fun things you came across,

283
00:13:37,279 --> 00:13:38,600
what beautiful things you saw,

284
00:13:39,159 --> 00:13:40,240
you would always tell me.

285
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,200
But now,

286
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:42,200
I can't find you anymore.

287
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,120
When I text you,

288
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:45,039
you reply only if you feel like it,

289
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,120
otherwise you don't.

290
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,039
In the entire airline,

291
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:48,399
no one knows about our relationship.

292
00:13:48,679 --> 00:13:49,200
Even today,

293
00:13:49,200 --> 00:13:50,320
I only knew you were with Ruan Sixian

294
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:51,759
because I passed by and saw the roster.

295
00:13:51,759 --> 00:13:52,600
That's how I found out.

296
00:13:52,759 --> 00:13:54,000
Fine. So from tomorrow on,

297
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,399
from the moment I wake up,

298
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,240
every person I see,

299
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:56,759
every leader I see.

300
00:13:56,759 --> 00:13:57,519
You know that's not

301
00:13:57,519 --> 00:13:58,519
what I meant at all.

302
00:13:58,519 --> 00:13:59,600
What more do you want me to do?

303
00:13:59,600 --> 00:14:00,159
Then what do you mean?

304
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:01,559
Right now, I can't feel your love.

305
00:14:01,559 --> 00:14:02,879
I can't feel it.

306
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:13,440
Since I'm so bad,

307
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,799
and you can't feel my love,

308
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:17,200
then let's just forget it.

309
00:14:22,440 --> 00:14:23,080
I'm sorry.

310
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,200
What are you saying?

311
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:30,519
I said I'm sorry.

312
00:14:36,759 --> 00:14:37,639
Jiang Ziyue, I think

313
00:14:37,639 --> 00:14:38,879
the person you should apologize to

314
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:39,879
isn't me,

315
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:41,279
but Ruan Sixian,

316
00:14:41,279 --> 00:14:42,559
whose work you disturbed today.

317
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:43,759
I'm sorry.

318
00:14:43,759 --> 00:14:44,720
I won't do this again.

319
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:52,720
Should we...

320
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,679
Should we go home?

321
00:14:58,039 --> 00:14:59,279
How can you change so quickly?

322
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,080
The way I see it, there are still things

323
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:01,720
between us

324
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,399
that haven't been resolved.

325
00:15:02,519 --> 00:15:03,639
I can't go home with you.

326
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:05,960
We can talk more at home.

327
00:15:06,159 --> 00:15:07,120
Yes, you can do that,

328
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:07,799
but I can't.

329
00:15:08,519 --> 00:15:09,440
I really haven't thought it through.

330
00:15:11,039 --> 00:15:12,080
Then what do you want me to do?

331
00:15:14,799 --> 00:15:15,360
I don't know either.

332
00:15:26,679 --> 00:15:27,440
There it is again.

333
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,159
That expression again.

334
00:15:29,159 --> 00:15:30,639
That look of disdain again.

335
00:15:30,639 --> 00:15:32,120
Every time, every time we fight,

336
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:32,919
I see it.

337
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:35,039
When I apologize, it's wrong.

338
00:15:35,279 --> 00:15:36,720
When I argue, it's wrong too.

339
00:15:37,559 --> 00:15:39,000
Have you ever respected me?

340
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:39,519
Yue Yang,

341
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:40,720
you always think

342
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,120
everything I do for you

343
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:43,799
is just what I should do, right?

344
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,440
Even today, I waited in line

345
00:15:45,720 --> 00:15:46,639
for such a long time

346
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,000
to buy you

347
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,039
your favorite food,

348
00:15:48,279 --> 00:15:49,679
and you didn't even say thank you.

349
00:15:49,679 --> 00:15:50,080
Thank you.

350
00:15:52,200 --> 00:15:53,240
Thank you for buying me

351
00:15:53,240 --> 00:15:54,519
my favorite food.

352
00:16:03,679 --> 00:16:04,720
Sometimes,

353
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:07,799
if you're not hungry,

354
00:16:07,799 --> 00:16:08,200
and you

355
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:09,480
force food into your stomach,

356
00:16:09,879 --> 00:16:10,639
it makes you feel

357
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:12,039
stuffed.

358
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,000
It feels uncomfortable.

359
00:16:14,919 --> 00:16:16,039
That's exactly how I feel right now.

360
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,240
You go back first.

361
00:16:20,519 --> 00:16:21,120
I still have work.

362
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,039
And over here,

363
00:17:01,039 --> 00:17:02,639
is a display of

364
00:17:02,639 --> 00:17:03,799
Hengshi flight attendant uniforms.

365
00:17:04,359 --> 00:17:05,039
You can see

366
00:17:05,319 --> 00:17:05,920
that the first set

367
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,279
is the earliest one we used,

368
00:17:07,279 --> 00:17:08,480
with epaulettes.

369
00:17:08,799 --> 00:17:09,799
Its overall style

370
00:17:09,799 --> 00:17:11,200
leans a bit toward a military look.

371
00:17:11,799 --> 00:17:12,839
The second set was

372
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:13,839
used in 1992.

373
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:14,880
You can see

374
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,640
the style changed quite a bit.

375
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:18,359
The third set was

376
00:17:18,359 --> 00:17:19,359
used in 1998.

377
00:17:19,720 --> 00:17:20,400
This set

378
00:17:20,400 --> 00:17:22,079
was used the longest by Hengshi

379
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:23,240
and is also the most

380
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,039
iconic one.

381
00:17:24,599 --> 00:17:25,039
Back then,

382
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:25,920
we specially

383
00:17:25,920 --> 00:17:27,240
invited a Hong Kong designer

384
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:28,279
to create it.

385
00:17:28,599 --> 00:17:29,759
It has been used ever since.

386
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:31,319
By the way,

387
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,039
"Captain" Ruan was once

388
00:17:33,039 --> 00:17:33,920
one of Hengshi

389
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,400
excellent cabin crew members.

390
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,400
Back then, she was wearing

391
00:17:37,400 --> 00:17:38,480
this 1998 uniform

392
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:39,519
while working.

393
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,960
So "Captain" Ruan must feel

394
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,480
very familiar seeing it.

395
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:43,200
Yes.

396
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:45,440
These three sets

397
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,680
each have their own features.

398
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,359
This 1998 set

399
00:17:48,359 --> 00:17:49,880
was also the first Chinese uniform

400
00:17:49,880 --> 00:17:51,160
to win the Blue Sky Design Award.

401
00:17:52,279 --> 00:17:54,519
It became our first

402
00:17:54,519 --> 00:17:55,559
award-winning Chinese civil aviation uniform.

403
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:07,920
Let's have lunch together.

404
00:18:11,759 --> 00:18:12,440
You're back.

405
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:16,640
If I hadn't come back sooner,

406
00:18:17,039 --> 00:18:17,680
I'm afraid "Captain" Ruan

407
00:18:17,680 --> 00:18:18,680
would have kicked me out.

408
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:28,839
Let's have a meal together.

409
00:18:29,799 --> 00:18:30,599
I have something to tell you.

410
00:18:35,519 --> 00:18:36,200
I can't join you.

411
00:18:37,039 --> 00:18:38,039
I'm accompanying visiting guests.

412
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,799
We'll be trying the simulator.

413
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:48,559
Bai Yang,

414
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:49,960
go to the training center.

415
00:18:50,240 --> 00:18:50,799
It's an emergency.

416
00:18:51,119 --> 00:18:51,400
Okay.

417
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:51,759
Let's go. Hurry.

418
00:18:56,279 --> 00:18:57,279
Welcome, everyone, to visit

419
00:18:57,279 --> 00:18:58,319
Hengshi simulator

420
00:18:58,319 --> 00:18:59,160
training center.

421
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:00,279
You can see

422
00:19:00,279 --> 00:19:01,599
there are four simulators here.

423
00:19:01,920 --> 00:19:03,079
The two in the middle

424
00:19:03,079 --> 00:19:04,680
are the new Z101 simulators

425
00:19:04,680 --> 00:19:06,000
we've introduced.

426
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,759
Some time ago,

427
00:19:07,759 --> 00:19:09,759
our pilots' flight training

428
00:19:09,880 --> 00:19:11,519
was also carried out here.

429
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:12,799
Moreover, these two

430
00:19:12,799 --> 00:19:14,160
are full-motion simulators.

431
00:19:14,519 --> 00:19:15,640
The feeling of piloting inside

432
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:17,279
is exactly like a real aircraft.

433
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:18,720
As for these two,

434
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,480
they are relatively newly introduced.

435
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:21,559
There's something different.

436
00:19:22,279 --> 00:19:23,839
Look at that. Look inside it.

437
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:24,599
Mr. Fu is here too.

438
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:26,160
Come.

439
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,519
This way, please. This way.

440
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:30,759
We're honored

441
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:32,880
to have Mr. Fu  personally accompanying us.

442
00:19:33,279 --> 00:19:34,359
Well, I must be pretty important.

443
00:19:35,279 --> 00:19:36,759
Since Ms. He has come in person,

444
00:19:37,039 --> 00:19:37,680
Hengshi

445
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:38,880
must not be negligent in any way.

446
00:19:38,960 --> 00:19:39,599
Not bad, not bad.

447
00:19:39,799 --> 00:19:40,759
Good job, Mr. Fu.

448
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,119
He's loved this kind of thing since he was little.

449
00:19:43,119 --> 00:19:43,759
Come this way.

450
00:19:45,519 --> 00:19:46,160
Why are you here?

451
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,559
Can't I come?

452
00:19:49,839 --> 00:19:50,680
I wouldn't dare.

453
00:19:51,599 --> 00:19:51,880
Come.

454
00:19:52,519 --> 00:19:53,880
Come, everyone. This way, please.

455
00:19:54,599 --> 00:19:54,920
Come, come.

456
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:55,359
Over here

457
00:19:55,359 --> 00:19:56,880
is the Hengshi lounge.

458
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:57,519
Come on in.

459
00:19:57,519 --> 00:19:58,119
Please, everyone, wait here.

460
00:19:58,119 --> 00:19:58,720
Ladies and gentlemen, follow me.

461
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,359
Take a short rest.

462
00:19:59,480 --> 00:20:00,359
Let's go rest over there.

463
00:20:00,359 --> 00:20:01,440
Try Hengshi

464
00:20:01,440 --> 00:20:02,119
coffee.

465
00:20:02,119 --> 00:20:02,440
Right.

466
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:03,559
Come, this way.

467
00:20:03,559 --> 00:20:04,200
Thank you, thank you.

468
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:04,960
Thank you, thank you.

469
00:20:05,279 --> 00:20:05,640
Welcome.

470
00:20:05,799 --> 00:20:06,480
Long time no see. Please sit.

471
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:07,240
Come, come.

472
00:20:07,559 --> 00:20:08,000
Sit, sit.

473
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:08,640
I'm actually a bit tired.

474
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,200
Please sit, please sit.

475
00:20:09,200 --> 00:20:09,559
Indeed.

476
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,039
Here, this way.

477
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,119
Miss Ruan,

478
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:18,160
come sit with us.

479
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,720
Is that appropriate?

480
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:24,519
It's fine.

481
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:26,319
Exactly,

482
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:27,240
what's inappropriate?

483
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:27,839
Come, come, come.

484
00:20:28,559 --> 00:20:29,640
I happen to have something to talk to you about.

485
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:29,920
Come.

486
00:20:30,799 --> 00:20:31,799
Come. Let's sit here.

487
00:20:45,720 --> 00:20:46,400
Miss Ruan,

488
00:20:46,759 --> 00:20:47,920
do you have a boyfriend?

489
00:20:51,119 --> 00:20:52,440
I'm just asking casually.

490
00:20:52,960 --> 00:20:54,079
At my age,

491
00:20:54,359 --> 00:20:55,799
I just like chatting about these things.

492
00:20:58,000 --> 00:20:58,720
Not yet.

493
00:21:00,599 --> 00:21:01,480
Then Miss Ruan

494
00:21:01,480 --> 00:21:02,839
definitely isn't in a hurry.

495
00:21:03,880 --> 00:21:05,039
So young and beautiful,

496
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:06,440
and so outstanding, right?

497
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:08,640
You must have many suitors.

498
00:21:09,559 --> 00:21:10,200
Not really.

499
00:21:11,240 --> 00:21:14,000
My social circle is very small.

500
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:15,839
And I'm quite busy too.

501
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,599
Still, you can't let work get in the way.

502
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,599
Marriage,

503
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,359
you don't have to rush into.

504
00:21:23,599 --> 00:21:24,599
But as for love,

505
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:25,880
you must date.

506
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:28,319
Just treat it as a pastime outside work.

507
00:21:30,559 --> 00:21:31,160
Later,

508
00:21:31,480 --> 00:21:32,599
I'll help you look around.

509
00:21:34,599 --> 00:21:35,119
Thank you.

510
00:21:35,559 --> 00:21:36,160
No need.

511
00:21:36,519 --> 00:21:37,200
It's nothing.

512
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,240
I

513
00:21:43,240 --> 00:21:44,240
happen to have

514
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:46,119
a son about

515
00:21:46,920 --> 00:21:47,400
your age.

516
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:51,279
He's kind of handsome,

517
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,160
and usually helps the family

518
00:21:53,319 --> 00:21:54,680
with the small business.

519
00:21:54,920 --> 00:21:55,960
As for his personality,

520
00:21:56,720 --> 00:21:57,279
it's not great.

521
00:21:58,359 --> 00:21:59,039
He's very quiet

522
00:21:59,480 --> 00:22:00,680
and doesn't talk much.

523
00:22:00,759 --> 00:22:02,039
And when he does speak,

524
00:22:02,039 --> 00:22:03,079
it's not very pleasant.

525
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:05,000
Better if he didn't.

526
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,599
But my son

527
00:22:07,599 --> 00:22:09,119
is quite generous with money.

528
00:22:09,319 --> 00:22:10,240
Very generous.

529
00:22:10,680 --> 00:22:11,160
Anyway,

530
00:22:11,519 --> 00:22:13,519
a person needs at least one good point,

531
00:22:13,599 --> 00:22:13,920
right?

532
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:16,440
So?

533
00:22:17,039 --> 00:22:18,279
Are you interested, Miss Ruan?

534
00:22:22,359 --> 00:22:23,039
Sorry,

535
00:22:23,039 --> 00:22:24,720
I really haven't

536
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,440
considered this for now.

537
00:22:26,440 --> 00:22:28,119
And I'm really quite busy.

538
00:22:28,200 --> 00:22:29,279
I'm afraid I'd have no time to spend with him.

539
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:33,519
Then find someone

540
00:22:33,519 --> 00:22:35,000
at work.

541
00:22:35,079 --> 00:22:36,000
That way,

542
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,319
it's convenient to spend time together, right?

543
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:38,160
Right, right.

544
00:22:39,359 --> 00:22:39,640
By the way,

545
00:22:40,319 --> 00:22:41,759
Mr. Fu seems to be single, right?

546
00:22:42,240 --> 00:22:42,519
Yes.

547
00:22:43,839 --> 00:22:44,839
What do you think of him?

548
00:22:48,559 --> 00:22:49,559
I think he's not that great.

549
00:22:56,119 --> 00:22:57,720
Have I ever been your boyfriend?

550
00:22:58,799 --> 00:23:00,440
How can "Captain" Ruan judge

551
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:01,720
that I wouldn't be good

552
00:23:01,720 --> 00:23:02,359
as your boyfriend?

553
00:23:03,200 --> 00:23:03,920
When I judge whether

554
00:23:03,920 --> 00:23:05,200
a refrigerator cools well,

555
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,279
do I have to get inside

556
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:07,039
and freeze for two days?

557
00:23:07,240 --> 00:23:08,400
Theoretically, that is correct.

558
00:23:13,519 --> 00:23:15,119
The guests are still here. Don't talk nonsense.

559
00:23:15,240 --> 00:23:15,920
Mind your image.

560
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:18,799
Sorry, Ms. He.

561
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:19,920
It's fine.

562
00:23:20,160 --> 00:23:21,119
Then let's talk tonight at home.

563
00:23:26,319 --> 00:23:28,160
Everyone, when visiting Hengshi,

564
00:23:28,160 --> 00:23:28,880
you must try

565
00:23:28,880 --> 00:23:29,920
the cafeteria.

566
00:23:30,559 --> 00:23:31,880
Every day there are different cuisines.

567
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:33,240
All eight major Chinese cuisines are available.

568
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:33,720
Really?

569
00:23:33,759 --> 00:23:34,400
There's also a small kitchen.

570
00:23:34,519 --> 00:23:34,799
Everyone,

571
00:23:35,240 --> 00:23:36,279
let's go upstairs and enjoy it slowly.

572
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:36,960
Come.

573
00:23:37,279 --> 00:23:38,880
Then I must try it.

574
00:23:38,960 --> 00:23:39,759
Certainly, certainly.

575
00:23:39,839 --> 00:23:40,599
Captain Ruan,

576
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,440
do you

577
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,519
usually eat at the cafeteria too?

578
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:43,759
You don't have time to cook, right?

579
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:45,000
I eat there occasionally.

580
00:23:46,240 --> 00:23:46,720
Come, after you.

581
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,079
Come on in, quickly.

582
00:23:51,480 --> 00:23:52,240
Please come in, everyone.

583
00:23:52,400 --> 00:23:52,960
Thank you, thank you.

584
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:53,279
Come, come.

585
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:53,720
Be careful.

586
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:54,319
Please come in.

