880
00:40:49,360 --> 00:40:50,079
encourage you

881
00:40:50,719 --> 00:40:51,840
to be brave.

882
00:40:52,440 --> 00:40:53,280
But I believe

883
00:40:55,000 --> 00:40:56,079
that if he's the right person,

884
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,280
his waiting

885
00:40:59,079 --> 00:40:59,880
will surely turn into

886
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:01,559
your growing courage.

887
00:41:02,400 --> 00:41:03,599
Since you've made up your mind,

888
00:41:04,239 --> 00:41:05,679
go bravely accept him.

889
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,760
Maybe the love that belongs to you

890
00:41:09,599 --> 00:41:10,719
should have come long ago.

891
00:42:01,639 --> 00:42:02,559
This work.

892
00:42:02,679 --> 00:42:02,920
Let's go.

893
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:05,400
Come in, let me broaden your horizons.

894
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:06,440
Come.

895
00:42:07,840 --> 00:42:08,760
Every fallen leaf

896
00:42:08,760 --> 00:42:10,360
carries the story of the seasons.

897
00:42:12,639 --> 00:42:13,760
Not bad.

898
00:42:14,559 --> 00:42:15,480
Not much investment

899
00:42:15,480 --> 00:42:16,519
but you've made it look decent.

900
00:42:16,559 --> 00:42:17,079
I suggest you

901
00:42:17,079 --> 00:42:18,239
don't ruin my mood today.

902
00:42:18,679 --> 00:42:20,360
Otherwise, on this auspicious day,

903
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:21,480
I'll send you straight to heaven.

904
00:42:22,159 --> 00:42:23,360
Watch your mouth.

905
00:42:23,639 --> 00:42:24,719
I came today to congratulate you.

906
00:42:24,719 --> 00:42:25,440
And you talk to me like this?

907
00:42:26,079 --> 00:42:26,599
Where's Fu Mingyu?

908
00:42:28,199 --> 00:42:29,239
I sent him an invitation.

909
00:42:29,639 --> 00:42:31,079
If he doesn't come, it's his loss.

910
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:32,719
Then why do I have to come?

911
00:42:32,719 --> 00:42:33,400
Double standards, huh?

912
00:42:33,599 --> 00:42:34,360
So what if it's double standards?

913
00:42:34,599 --> 00:42:35,360
Why am I only strict with you

914
00:42:35,360 --> 00:42:36,079
and not others?

915
00:42:36,239 --> 00:42:37,159
Think about it yourself.

916
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:39,559
Mom.

917
00:42:40,320 --> 00:42:42,400
Happy opening, Madam Zheng.

918
00:42:42,880 --> 00:42:43,559
Where's my father?

919
00:42:43,920 --> 00:42:44,559
Don't ask.

920
00:42:44,639 --> 00:42:45,800
He's at home sulking because of you.

921
00:42:46,119 --> 00:42:47,360
He says you didn't send him an invitation.

922
00:42:47,719 --> 00:42:48,280
So dramatic.

923
00:42:48,880 --> 00:42:49,760
Let me show you inside.

924
00:42:49,880 --> 00:42:50,400
No need.

925
00:42:50,719 --> 00:42:51,800
Go attend to your guests.

926
00:42:51,920 --> 00:42:52,679
I'll look around on my own.

927
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,440
Then call me if you need anything, Mom.

928
00:42:54,559 --> 00:42:55,079
Okay.

929
00:42:57,599 --> 00:42:58,679
Ruan,

930
00:42:59,360 --> 00:43:00,679
I knew you wouldn't miss it.

931
00:43:01,079 --> 00:43:01,840
Happy opening.

932
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:03,199
I'm a simple person.

933
00:43:03,599 --> 00:43:05,039
I didn't know what to give you.

934
00:43:07,119 --> 00:43:07,760
Just a small token.

935
00:43:08,199 --> 00:43:09,320
This red envelope

936
00:43:10,039 --> 00:43:12,000
really hits the spot.

937
00:43:13,280 --> 00:43:15,239
What I lack most right now is money.

938
00:43:15,840 --> 00:43:16,920
Go inside and look around first.

939
00:43:17,400 --> 00:43:17,880
I also have a gift

940
00:43:18,320 --> 00:43:19,239
to give you in a bit.
